{"1353450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VoltHaven", "steam_appid": 1353450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VoltHaven is real-time management simulation of electric grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start from scratch in village without energy infrastructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build various power sources and utility buildings as backbone of your grid. Connect first customers and earn money to expand. Advance from makeshift or cheap &amp; obsolete technology to modern power plants, to be able to connect more customers or cut running costs. You can also engage in growing crops or mining resources to up your cash flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And while doing this, try to maintain reliable electricity flow with minimal power outages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/ee4010b3abf55aeb0e8ccc59c6425345.poster.avif?t=1780504209\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/ee4010b3abf55aeb0e8ccc59c6425345.webm?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/ee4010b3abf55aeb0e8ccc59c6425345.mp4?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Build anywhere, surroundings will adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/bb39a997e7ba96f8107198f211ce9f31.poster.avif?t=1780504209\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/bb39a997e7ba96f8107198f211ce9f31.webm?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/bb39a997e7ba96f8107198f211ce9f31.mp4?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reorganize anything when needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/029eddc57ad621eb03400371b324e186.poster.avif?t=1780504209\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/029eddc57ad621eb03400371b324e186.webm?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/029eddc57ad621eb03400371b324e186.mp4?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connecting structures to grid makes energy flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/e76198eee41d687b2e738a1cd6f9c887.poster.avif?t=1780504209\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/e76198eee41d687b2e738a1cd6f9c887.webm?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/e76198eee41d687b2e738a1cd6f9c887.mp4?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refuel and upgrade power plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/93dc38f5bc7f01995a96a73d307bc685.poster.avif?t=1780504209\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/93dc38f5bc7f01995a96a73d307bc685.webm?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/93dc38f5bc7f01995a96a73d307bc685.mp4?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand weather impact on renewable sources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/023638954e765056a836ecd1572e01bd.poster.avif?t=1780504209\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/023638954e765056a836ecd1572e01bd.webm?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/023638954e765056a836ecd1572e01bd.mp4?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm &amp; sell produce to up cashflow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >energy generation types like Thermal, Wind, Solar, Nuclear, Hydro</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >electricity sources ranging from small kilowatt generators to high megawatt power plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your customers will be individual households, small businesses and large factories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >commodities (like Diesel, Coal or Wood) are used mainly for fuel, but you can also produce and trade them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >adapt to local and seasonal weather changes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >designed for Free play/Sandbox as base mode, with Campaign and Challenge missions built on it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >underlying simulation model with real-time calculation of power flow in grid structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >uses individual customer's time-based energy profiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >renewable power depends on wind speed, sun elevation or temperature, with intraday and seasonal variances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weather and economy parameters are based on present European data</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VoltHaven is real-time management simulation of electric grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start from scratch in village without energy infrastructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build various power sources and utility buildings as backbone of your grid. Connect first customers and earn money to expand. Advance from makeshift or cheap &amp; obsolete technology to modern power plants, to be able to connect more customers or cut running costs. You can also engage in growing crops or mining resources to up your cash flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And while doing this, try to maintain reliable electricity flow with minimal power outages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/ee4010b3abf55aeb0e8ccc59c6425345.poster.avif?t=1780504209\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/ee4010b3abf55aeb0e8ccc59c6425345.webm?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/ee4010b3abf55aeb0e8ccc59c6425345.mp4?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Build anywhere, surroundings will adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/bb39a997e7ba96f8107198f211ce9f31.poster.avif?t=1780504209\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/bb39a997e7ba96f8107198f211ce9f31.webm?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/bb39a997e7ba96f8107198f211ce9f31.mp4?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reorganize anything when needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/029eddc57ad621eb03400371b324e186.poster.avif?t=1780504209\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/029eddc57ad621eb03400371b324e186.webm?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/029eddc57ad621eb03400371b324e186.mp4?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connecting structures to grid makes energy flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/e76198eee41d687b2e738a1cd6f9c887.poster.avif?t=1780504209\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/e76198eee41d687b2e738a1cd6f9c887.webm?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/e76198eee41d687b2e738a1cd6f9c887.mp4?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refuel and upgrade power plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/93dc38f5bc7f01995a96a73d307bc685.poster.avif?t=1780504209\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/93dc38f5bc7f01995a96a73d307bc685.webm?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/93dc38f5bc7f01995a96a73d307bc685.mp4?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand weather impact on renewable sources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/023638954e765056a836ecd1572e01bd.poster.avif?t=1780504209\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/023638954e765056a836ecd1572e01bd.webm?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/extras/023638954e765056a836ecd1572e01bd.mp4?t=1780504209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm &amp; sell produce to up cashflow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >energy generation types like Thermal, Wind, Solar, Nuclear, Hydro</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >electricity sources ranging from small kilowatt generators to high megawatt power plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your customers will be individual households, small businesses and large factories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >commodities (like Diesel, Coal or Wood) are used mainly for fuel, but you can also produce and trade them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >adapt to local and seasonal weather changes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >designed for Free play/Sandbox as base mode, with Campaign and Challenge missions built on it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >underlying simulation model with real-time calculation of power flow in grid structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >uses individual customer's time-based energy profiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >renewable power depends on wind speed, sun elevation or temperature, with intraday and seasonal variances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weather and economy parameters are based on present European data</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Build electric grid in small settlement. Advance from outdated generators to modern powerplants, use fossils and renewables. Accomodate growing customer base and weather changes. Farms or mines provide extra income. Map-free layout with drag-and-drop simplicity. Simulation based on european data.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/b76a467612fa9624a9ad3bf5372f291f377a0a1d/header.jpg?t=1780504209", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/df3c14da8e51cb80e6b396aa4cbf092d4a32de1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780504209", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353450/df3c14da8